WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.860
In this lesson, you will learn to use the hop block and repeat to make characters bounce and celebrate.

2
00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.110
Hop jumps up and comes back down in the same place.

3
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.740
Put hop inside a repeat to bounce many times.

4
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.700
Characters can hop when they reach a goal — hooray!

5
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.560
Repeat 3 makes 3 hops.

6
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.290
Change the number for more.

7
00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.280
Walk to the star, then hop 3 times to celebrate! Use 🔁.

8
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.250
Hop, hop, hop — hooray!

9
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.570
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:35.700
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
